{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54563","headline":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 二十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占气第四（京本作「占气第二十三」○三十一首） 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"占败气，如纲又如蛇。\n赤气照天营上起，又如破屋坏毡车，其下死如麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}